 * Name: netdev_lower_vlan_add
 *
 * Description:
 *   Add a VLAN device to the network device.
 *
 * Input Parameters:
 *   dev  - The lower half device driver structure
 *   vid  - VLAN ID
 *   vlan - The VLAN device to add
 *
 * Returned Value:
